     fhir:div [ fhir:v "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ValueSet edible-substance-type</b></p><a name=\"edible-substance-type\"> </a><a name=\"hcedible-substance-type\"> </a><p>This value set includes codes based on the following rules:</p><ul><li>Include codes from<a href=\"http://www.snomed.org/\"><code>http://snomed.info/sct</code></a><span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated. No matching Code System found\"> version Not Stated (use latest from terminology server)</span> where concept  is-a 762766007 (Edible substance (substance))</li><li>Include codes from<a href=\"http://www.snomed.org/\"><code>http://snomed.info/sct</code></a><span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated. No matching Code System found\"> version Not Stated (use latest from terminology server)</span> where concept  is-a 412413001 (Infant formula (product))</li><li>Include codes from<a href=\"http://www.snomed.org/\"><code>http://snomed.info/sct</code></a><span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated. No matching Code System found\"> version Not Stated (use latest from terminology server)</span> where concept  is-a 346415002 (Enteral+supplement feeds)</li><li>Include codes from<a href=\"http://www.snomed.org/\"><code>http://snomed.info/sct</code></a><span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated. No matching Code System found\"> version Not Stated (use latest from terminology server)</span> where concept  is-a 890302005 (Potable water (substance))</li><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"http://www.snomed.org/\"><code>http://snomed.info/sct</code></a><span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated. No matching Code System found\"> version Not Stated (use latest from terminology server)</span><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/id/11713004\">11713004</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Water</td></tr><tr><td><a hre